    "player_count": {
      "label": "Player Count",
      "start": "0x000620EA",
      "encoding": "int",
      "length": 1,
      "_notes": [
        "Volatile work RAM, found via headless libpinmame triangulation (1-player vs 2-player starts, 98% snapshot consistency): 0 in attract, increments on each Start press during ball 1, holds the player count for the whole game and until the next game starts. bbb109-specific: the same address reads 0 on bbb108 and Breakshot (bsv103)."
      ]
    },
    "credits": {
      "label": "Credits",
      "start": "0x30000010",
      "encoding": "int",
      "length": 1,
      "_notes": [
        "Battery DRAM, platform-wide: verified against user-reported credit counts on bbb109 (7), bsv103 (5) and pmv112 (4), and observed incrementing on coin insertion in a headless probe. (0x3000139C, previously mapped, is a different counter that only coincidentally matched on bbb/bsv.)"
      ]
    },
    "game_over": {
      "_notes": [
        "Game-in-progress flag in DRAM (volatile RAM, not in the .nv). Found via libpinmame, verified across Breakshot/Big Bang Bar/Pinball Magic: 0x000012F2 bit 0x40 is SET during a game, CLEAR in attract and at game over. invert=true so the field reads true when the game is over."
      ],
      "label": "Game Over",
      "start": "0x000012F2",
      "encoding": "bool",
      "mask": "0x40",
      "invert": true
    }
  },
